    "계속하면 [개인정보 처리방침](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/privacy-policy.html)과 [서비스 약관](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/terms-of-service.html)에 동의한 것으로 간주합니다." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du fortfährst, stimmst du der [Datenschutzerklärung](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/privacy-policy.html) und den [Nutzungsbedingungen](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/terms-of-service.html) zu."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "By continuing, you agree to the [Privacy Policy](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/privacy-policy.html) and [Terms of Service](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/terms-of-service.html)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al continuar, aceptas la [Política de privacidad](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/privacy-policy.html) y los [Términos del servicio](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/terms-of-service.html)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En continuant, vous acceptez la [Politique de confidentialité](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/privacy-policy.html) et les [Conditions d’utilisation](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/terms-of-service.html)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Continuando, accetti l'[Informativa sulla privacy](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/privacy-policy.html) e i [Termini di servizio](https://jung-geun.github.io/SIFT/terms-of-service.html)."
          }
